# core.autocrlf is true on the Windows machines this repo is worked on. Git
# normally spots binaries by itself, but the world art is nine megabytes of
# video and stills that would be silently corrupted if that heuristic ever
# missed, and a mangled .mp4 does not announce itself: it just stops playing
# for everyone. Say it outright instead of trusting detection.
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.wasm binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
